setting memory.backend=mnemopi: the nightly dream reviews and consolidates the agent's mnemopi memory
setting mnemopi.scoping=global: the dream reads one shared memory bank, not one bank per project
setting mnemopi.autoRetain=false: the agent retains memories on purpose, so the dream reviews those and not a copy of every turn
setting mnemopi.noEmbeddings=true: underground runs mnemopi without an embedding model, so recall uses full-text search only
setting skills.enabled=true: the review flow loads the dream-review skill when the user says 'review the dream'
setting worktree.onStart=create: agent-start hard-resets the main checkout of each repo, so the agent must work in a linked worktree
file .omp/agent/skills/dream-review/SKILL.md: the review flow loads this skill when the user says 'review the dream'
file .omp/agent/extensions/underground-guard.ts: this extension blocks destructive commands of the agent
